operations.profile_deletion.review.body:
Virtual machine: {vm_name}
VM ID: {vm_id}
GPU: {gpu_interface}

Delete this VM's app profile: its saved GPU settings, authorized VM/GPU pairing, managed setup history and interrupted-operation records. Recovery records for this profile are discarded even if an earlier operation did not finish. Pending edits for this profile are discarded too.

Keep the Hyper-V VM, its current GPU support, disks, checkpoints and guest driver files. No VM power change, GPU detachment, driver removal or guest sign-in is performed. Other profiles are unchanged.

Delete profile confirms this review; Windows requests approval to remove the protected app records. Cancel keeps the profile. The VM stays discoverable for a future reviewed setup.
